        "created_at": "2018-03-27T21:35:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You can run this system with knowing the lore. My players have taken characters in interesting directions. The system is very fun and lose.</p>\n<p>Now if you do wanna hear the lore there is The Letter Page podcast where Christopher and Adam are reading letter to us. . .  It them expanding on the lore of the world.</p>\n<p>I do want to note that they are comic book fans. The Sentinels world has another world with a plushblish company that prints Sentinels. Very meta.</p>",
